      "before": "<a href=\"/orleans/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graincollectionoptions/properties/\">ActivationTimeout</a> 和 <a href=\"/orleans/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graincollectionoptions/properties/\">DeactivationTimeout</a> 的默认值均为 30 秒。超时后，Orleans 会取消传给 <a href=\"/orleans/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">OnActivateAsync</a>、<a href=\"/orleans/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">OnActivateAsync</a> 以及 Grain 生命周期参与者的 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.cancellationtoken\"> CancellationToken </a>，然后等待这些代码执行完成。在这些回调返回之前，激活实例会保留其 Grain 目录注册和激活实例作用域内的服务。如果激活超时，激活会在回调返回后失败。如果停用超时，停用会在回调返回后继续。",
      "after": "<a href=\"/orleans/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graincollectionoptions/properties/\">ActivationTimeout</a> 和 <a href=\"/orleans/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.runtime/orleans.configuration.graincollectionoptions/properties/\">DeactivationTimeout</a> 的默认值均为 30 秒。超时后，Orleans 会取消传给 <a href=\"/orleans/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">OnActivateAsync</a>、<a href=\"/orleans/docs/api/csharp/microsoft.orleans.core.abstractions/orleans.grain/methods/\">OnDeactivateAsync</a> 以及 Grain 生命周期参与者的 <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.threading.cancellationtoken\"> CancellationToken </a>，然后等待这些代码执行完成。在这些回调返回之前，激活实例会保留其 Grain 目录注册和激活实例作用域内的服务。如果激活超时，激活会在回调返回后失败。如果停用超时，停用会在回调返回后继续。"
